  "beats": [
    {
      "beat_id": 1,
      "text": "How can an AI become smart enough to build other AI agents? It\u2019s like a sculptor teaching a student how to carve marble statues.",
      "visual_focus": "A glowing AI brain cluster spawning smaller, identical robotic controller agents into a clean workspace.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "AI agents": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Qwen-Planner",
        "action_verb": "spawns",
        "direct_object": "Robotic Planner Agents",
        "anchor_word": "build",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 2,
      "text": "Real-world mobile robots are chaotic. Teaching them is like trying to guide a blindfolded person through a library while the shelves keep shifting.",
      "visual_focus": "A robotic arm fumbling in a shifting 3D grid environment representing complex mobile planning tasks.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "chaotic": "#EF4444"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Mobile Agent",
        "action_verb": "navigates",
        "direct_object": "Shifting Workspace Trajectories",
        "anchor_word": "chaotic",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 3,
      "text": "Instead of guessing, we build a data flywheel. The AI constructs its own training tasks, curating perfect examples of what success looks like daily.",
      "visual_focus": "A circular loop diagram where training data feeds into a model, which then produces better task data for itself.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "data flywheel": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Data Flywheel",
        "action_verb": "curates",
        "direct_object": "Human-gated Training Tasks",
        "anchor_word": "curating",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "The model uses a competence-aware mechanism to chip away unnecessary tool usage costs, keeping only the most efficient skills for every complex action.",
      "visual_focus": "An optimization gate filtering a list of skills; unnecessary tools fade away, leaving only high-precision planning commands.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "efficient skills": "#F59E0B"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Competence-Aware Gate",
        "action_verb": "prunes",
        "direct_object": "High-Cost Planning Tools",
        "anchor_word": "chip away",
        "semantic_role": "causal_elimination"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 5,
      "text": "This closed-loop orchestration creates a model that outperforms all previous benchmarks, proving AI can effectively bootstrap its own growth and real-world intelligence.",
      "visual_focus": "A bar chart showing Qwen-Planner rising above all other competitors on a benchmark scale.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "outperforms": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Qwen-Planner-Agent",
        "action_verb": "surpasses",
        "direct_object": "MobilePA-Bench Baseline",
        "anchor_word": "outperforms",
        "semantic_role": "metric_evaluation"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 6,
      "text": "Follow The Model Verse for simple explanations of how modern AI actually works.",
      "visual_focus": "The Model Verse logo appears with a subtle pulse, indicating the end of the technical breakdown.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "The Model Verse": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "The Model Verse",
        "action_verb": "simplifies",
        "direct_object": "Modern AI Architecture",
        "anchor_word": "explanations",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      }
    }
  ],
